ober CMS</span><span>Responzivní design</span></p>", "_css_classes": "ww-tags"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "655611b", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "80a7578", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "02", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "f5d0969", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "E-shopy", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3", "link": {"url": "/tvorba-eshopu/", "is_external": "", "nofollow": ""}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "2c91bfd", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Přehledný obchod připravený na růst. Objednávky, platby i doprava bez starostí.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "49bc3d6", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p><span>WooCommerce</span><span>PrestaShop</span></p>", "_css_classes": "ww-tags"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "ed259df", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "7ae5a13", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "03", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "f3ab6d2", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Redesign webu", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3", "link": {"url": "/redesign-webu/", "is_external": "", "nofollow": ""}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "6a2a3aa", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Starý web, který nic nepřináší? Převlékneme ho do moderního kabátu a postavíme znovu – tentokrát na prodej.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "0d433a5", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p><span>Nový design